class=\"bb_tag\"> &gt; Strategically Cool hacking combos are the way of prestige in The Murky Web; </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757450/extras/daa028a1566c64c134fbc3a6f1a941cb.poster.avif?t=1749590876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757450/extras/daa028a1566c64c134fbc3a6f1a941cb.webm?t=1749590876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757450/extras/daa028a1566c64c134fbc3a6f1a941cb.mp4?t=1749590876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> &gt; Tag Team with hackers and security specialists // Or against them; </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757450/extras/b45edc9689fc13a9da6396f818b4d63d.poster.avif?t=1749590876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757450/extras/b45edc9689fc13a9da6396f818b4d63d.webm?t=1749590876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757450/extras/b45edc9689fc13a9da6396f818b4d63d.mp4?t=1749590876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&gt; Gameplay();</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hack the Mainframe, the VPN, and a RAT</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>66</strong> nodes to hack, with as much additional optional hacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Open-ended</strong>: Exploit security and hackers to ascend in The Murky Web</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hackers will hack you back <strong>!!!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optimize the most <strong>stylish</strong> shots ever</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Iterate with ease</strong>: Tools to save shots, edit shots, save, load and merge solutions, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tens of additional hand-crafted, underhanded hacking <strong>challenges</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Over <strong>7000</strong> unique Cyberballs to craft </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&gt; Story();</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pop-up Ads won't go away, you hack them back. Will that scammer retaliate ?!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hack into devices, view files, get nosy, message other hackers and specialists, and discover the various factions of The Murky Web</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757450/extras/0739b1c8fde3ecc8bf7b77573914dd02.avif?t=1749590876\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">&gt; Accessibility_and_game_settings();</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Supports both windowed and fullscreen, and ultrawide screen resolutions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Button remapping, and support for keyboard and mouse or mouse only </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> An expansive set of over 40 options to customize Gameplay, Controls, Graphics, Audio, etc. to your liking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> There is a quit button in the game :)</p></li></ul>",
